                </div>
             <div class="apm-centerthirdcol apm-wrap">
                                                       <h3 class="a-spacing-mini"> PDT650 - Pocket Folding Thermometer </h3>                                                                     <p class="a-spacing-base"> The PDT650 is a versatile and rugged pocket thermometer featuring an extended temperature range, built-in magnetic mount, folding temperature probe and a large easy-to-read display. The PDT650 provides reliable and accurate measurements in demanding environments. They are perfect for HVAC, refrigeration and food service areas, or anywhere temperature monitoring is critical. </p>     </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
<div style="clear:both"></div>
    </div>

         <div class="celwidget aplus-module module-9 aplus-standard" cel_widget_id="aplus-module-9">
                  <div class="aplus-module-wrapper apm-fixed-width apm-spacing">
                                       <div class="apm-flex">
        <div class="apm-flex-item-third-width">
            <p class="apm-text-center">
                                                      <img alt="" src="https://images-na.ssl-images-amazon.com/images/G/01/x-locale/common/grey-pixel.gif" class="a-spacing-mini a-lazy-loaded" data-src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media/mg/944e614f-858b-4692-ab14-ef18b2c71fcc._SL300__.jpg"/><noscript><img alt="" src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media/mg/944e614f-858b-4692-ab14-ef18b2c71fcc._SL300__.jpg"/></noscript>  </p>
                                                   <h4 class="a-spacing-mini"> Functions </h4>                                      <p> &#039;-58 to 572˚F (-50 to 300˚C). </p>     <p> Folding temperature probe Built-in magnetic mount. </p>     <p> MIN/MAX record. </p>     <p> Auto power off. </p>     <p> Large easy to read Display. </p>    </div>
        <div class="apm-flex-item-third-width">
            <p class="apm-text-center">
                                                      <img alt="" src="https://images-na.ssl-images-amazon.com/images/G/01/x-locale/common/grey-pixel.gif" class="a-spacing-mini a-lazy-loaded" data-src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media/mg/e01da356-99de-4acb-8dcb-227f2ec30dfe._SL300__.jpg"/><noscript><img alt="" src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media/mg/e01da356-99de-4acb-8dcb-227f2ec30dfe._SL300__.jpg"/></noscript>  </p>
                                                   <h4 class="a-spacing-mini"> Applications </h4>                                      <p> The PDT650 offers a folding temperature probe in conjunction with a built-in magnetic mount. The combination of these features offers a pocket–sized thermometer flexible enough to be used in diverse applications. The probe reads in any folding position and the exposed tip gives accurate readings even when closed. </p>    </div>
        <div class="apm-flex-item-third-width">
            <p class="apm-text-center">
                                                      <img alt="" src="https://images-na.ssl-images-amazon.com/images/G/01/x-locale/common/grey-pixel.gif" class="a-spacing-mini a-lazy-loaded" data-src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media/mg/c5f051b0-b287-4689-8553-7d29229057ca._SL300__.jpg"/><noscript><img alt="" src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media/mg/c5f051b0-b287-4689-8553-7d29229057ca._SL300__.jpg"/></noscript>  </p>
                                                   <h4 class="a-spacing-mini"> Warranty </h4>                                      <p> The PDT650 is warranted to be free from defects in materials and workmanship for a period of three years from the date of purchase. </p>    </div>
    </div>
</div>
<div style="clear:both"></div>
    </div>

