ted Range, 6 Sensors with NIST Certified Accuracy, 2 Probes for Kitchen, BBQ, Grill, Oven, Smoker, Rotisserie\&quot;},\&quot;offer\&quot;:{\&quot;contributors\&quot;:[{\&quot;link\&quot;:{\&quot;rel\&quot;:\&quot;brandStoreUrl-default\&quot;,\&quot;url\&quot;:\&quot;/stores/ThermoMaven/page/0496D2D2-830F-43B7-BD16-8AF56369F258?lp_asin=B0D1TMFTPN&amp;ref_=ast_bln&amp;store_ref=bl_ast_dp_brandlogo_sto\&quot;},\&quot;name\&quot;:\&quot;ThermoMaven\&quot;,\&quot;roles\&quot;:[{\&quot;displayString\&quot;:\&quot;Brand\&quot;,\&quot;type\&quot;:\&quot;BRAND\&quot;}],\&quot;brandBrowseNode\&quot;:{\&quot;id\&quot;:\&quot;0\&quot;}}],\&quot;productImages\&quot;:[{\&quot;extension\&quot;:\&quot;jpg\&quot;,\&quot;height\&quot;:1920,\&quot;physicalId\&quot;:\&quot;71Mhqhh0y5L\&quot;,\&quot;variant\&quot;:\&quot;MAIN\&quot;,\&quot;width\&quot;:1920},{\&quot;extension\&quot;:\&quot;jpg\&quot;,\&quot;height\&quot;:1920,\&quot;physicalId\&quot;:\&quot;71P-qhzBRiL\&quot;,\&quot;variant\&quot;:\&quot;PT01\&quot;,\&quot;width\&quot;:1920},{\&quot;extension\&quot;:\&quot;jpg\&quot;,\&quot;height\&quot;:1920,\&quot;physicalId\&quot;:\&quot;61i7kVqX2CL\&quot;,\&quot;variant\&quot;:\&quot;PT02\&quot;,\&quot;width\&quot;:1920},{\&quot;extension\&quot;:\&quot;jpg\&quot;,\&quot;height\&quot;:1920,\&quot;physicalId\&quot;:\&quot;81Ig+Ii49wL\&quot;,\&quot;variant\&quot;:\&quot;PT03\&quot;,\&quot;width\&quot;:1920},{\&quot;extension\&quot;:\&quot;jpg\&quot;,\&quot;height\&quot;:1920,\&quot;physicalId\&quot;:\&quot;81qQc+4NA0L\&quot;,\&quot;variant\&quot;:\&quot;PT04\&quot;,\&quot;width\&quot;:1920},{\&quot;extension\&quot;:\&quot;jpg\&quot;,\&quot;height\&quot;:1920,\&quot;physicalId\&quot;:\&quot;61PNq8a-hFL\&quot;,\&quot;variant\&quot;:\&quot;PT05\&quot;,\&quot;width\&quot;:1920},{\&quot;extension\&quot;:\&quot;jpg\&quot;,\&quot;height\&quot;:2400,\&quot;physicalId\&quot;:\&quot;81nMrYUU01L\&quot;,\&quot;variant\&quot;:\&quot;PT06\&quot;,\&quot;width\&quot;:2400},{\&quot;extension\&quot;:\&quot;jpg\&quot;,\&quot;height\&quot;:1536,\&quot;physicalId\&quot;:\&quot;71VZK7AvCSL\&quot;,\&quot;variant\&quot;:\&quot;RF00\&quot;,\&quot;width\&quot;:1536}],\&quot;averageCustomerReviews\&quot;:{\&quot;reviewCount\&quot;:2096,\&quot;fullStarCount\&quot;:4,\&quot;displayString\&quot;:\&quot;4.4 out of 5 stars\&quot;,\&quot;value\&quot;:4.4,\&quot;hasHalfStar\&quot;:true},\&quot;binding\&quot;:{\&quot;displayString\&quot;:\&quot;Misc.\&quot;,\&quot;symbol\&quot;:\&quot;miscellaneous\&quot;},\&quot;twisterVariations\&quot;:{\&quot;dimensionKeys\&quot;:[{\&quot;symbol\&quot;:\&quot;color_name\&quot;,\&quot;displayString\&quot;:\&quot;Color\&quot;}],\&quot;hasVariations\&quot;:true},\&quot;hasTwisterVariations\&quot;:true,\&quot;featureBullets\&quot;:[\&quot;Smart Display Base: Unlike other thermometers that require an app to function, the P2’s smart base provides direct target temperature setting and real-time readings display. For advanced features like cooking history and AI-guided cooking, the free ThermoMaven APP (iOS/Andriod) is also available, giving you the best of both worlds.\&quot;,\&quot;Unlimited Range via Wi-Fi: Unlike Bluetooth-only thermometer, the ThermoMaven P2 uses 2.4GHz Wi-Fi to connect the base to your phone for truly unlimited range. Requires a 2.4GHz Wi-Fi network (compatible with most home routers; if your router is dual-band, connect the base to the 2.4GHz band). Monitor your cooking from anywhere in your home or outside.\&quot;,\&quot;100% Wireless Freedom: Kiss tangled wires goodbye with the ThermoMaven P2. Roam freely with Bluetooth long-range connectivity, linking seamlessly from the base to the probes.\&quot;,\&quot;6-Sensor Accuracy: Equipped with 6 sensors (5 internal and 1 external), the precision of ThermoMaven P2 meat probe is NIST-certified, delivering ±0.5°F accuracy and 0.01°F resolution. You can confidently ensure your food is never undercooked or overcooked.\&quot;,\&quot;Two Ultra-Thin Probes: Allows you to monitor time and temperature for two different dishes at once. The ultra-thin design preserves the integrity of your proteins and retains their juices, ensuring perfectly cooked meat every time.\&quot;,\&quot;Effortless Cleanup: With a superior IPX8 waterproof rating, the ThermoMaven wireless probes can be safely placed in the dishwasher after use. Enjoy your meal and relax with no hassle!\&quot;,\&quot;High-Temp Grilling: The wireless meat probes simultaneously track both the internal meat temperature (up to 221°F) and the ambient griil/oven temperature (up to 752°F) for accurate cooking results.You can safely keep the probe in place, even while searing, for continuous temperature monitoring.\&quot;,\&quot;Charge Once, Cook All Day: Base charges in 2 hours for 24+ hours of continuous use. Probes charge 2 min for 2 hours work. Perfect your cooking every time.\&quot;],\&quot;links\&quot;:[{\&quot;url\&quot;:\&quot;/ThermoMaven-Wireless-Bluetooth-Smart-Thermometer/dp/B0D1TMFTPN\&quot;}],\&quot;productCategory\&quot;:{\&quot;glProductGroup\&quot;:{\&quot;symbol\&quot;:\&quot;gl_kitchen\&quot;},\&quot;productType\&quot;:\&quot;THERMOMETER\&quot;,\&quot;productCategoryId\&quot;:\&quot;7907200\&quot;,\&quot;productSubcategoryId\&quot;:\&quot;7907229\&quot;},\&quot;prices\&quot;:{\&quot;mainPrice\&quot;:{\&quot;price\&quot;:{\&quot;currency\&quot;:{\&quot;amount\&quot;:84.99,\&quot;currencyCode\&quot;:\&quot;USD\&quot;,\&quot;displayString\&quot;:\&quot;$84.99\&quot;},\&quot;currencyRange\&quot;:{},\&quot;pricePerUnit\&quot;:{\&quot;baseValueAmount\&quot;:0},\&quot;type\&quot;:\&quot;BUYING\&quot;,\&quot;label\&quot;:\&quot;Prime Price:\&quot;,\&quot;addToCartUrl\&quot;:\&quot;https://www.amazon.com/advertising/atc?ie=UTF8&amp;token=75559DEFC3FB4AE5DCB611ABD8F0C1FE06368E62&amp;time=1782299381870&amp;merchantId=A20TH74TB1RQKE&amp;asin=B0D1TMFTPN&amp;program=dads&amp;adPrice=84.99&amp;offerListingId=Ly7uU0nFKuviKGbz0BWqd46Ig4VHukgiHnxXFP8i8ffEY3Ve7oJSkLP8OuyANGuqWXdqvThDdTsFJiMiV74QRvdN%252BxV