" data-a-card-type="peekExpand"><div class="a-cardui-body _Y3Itd_no-padding_1A9ha"><div class="a-reactive-container"><div><div class="a-cardui-content a-cardui-uninitialized" data-a-max-height="300" style="max-height:300px"><div class="_Y3Itd_relative_1SChh"><div data-hook="reviewRichContentContainer" lang="en-US" class="_Y3Itd_contain-rich-content_2IORW"><p><span>The UEi Test Instruments PDT650 Folding Pocket Digital Thermometer is very well made and accurate. The price is right, but I wish it had a backlit readout area. I highly recommend this item.</span></p></div></div></div></div><div class="a-reactive-container-gradient"></div></div></div><div data-hook="reviewExpandButtonContainer" class="a-cardui-footer _Y3Itd_no-padding_1A9ha"><div class="a-cardui-expand-control-footer _Y3Itd_read-more-less_2uDYd" data-csa-c-type="widget" data-csa-interaction-events="click"><a href="javascript:void(0)" class="a-cardui-expand-control-footer-button" role="button"><span class="a-expander-icon"><i class="a-css-icon"></i></span><span class="a-see-more a-color-link"><span class="a-see-more-text" style="display:none">Read more</span><span class="a-see-less-text" style="display:none">Read less</span></span></a></div></div></div></div><div data-hook="translationSpinner" class="_Y3Itd_single-review-translation-spinner-container_ypxf2"><div class="a-spinner-wrapper _Y3Itd_single-review-translation-spinner_1tBUJ"><span class="a-spinner a-spinner-medium"></span></div></div></div><div class="a-section a-spacing-small a-spacing-top-small"><div class="_Y3Itd_single-review-vote-action-bar_10AyR"><div data-hook="helpfulVoteWidget" class="a-section a-spacing-none _Y3Itd_cr-voting-section_1cNTp"><div class="_Y3Itd_cr-helpful-button_1u3UK cr-vote-component" data-hook="helpfulVoteButton" data-mix-operations="HelpfulVoteClickHandler" data-asin="B004WE73N2" data-id="R3VTFPE7ES9Z73" data-return-to="DpReview" data-csa-c-type="element" data-csa-c-slot-id="customer_review-R3VTFPE7ES9Z73_helpful_button