0 60 46.5685 60 30C60 13.4315 46.5685 0 30 0C13.4315 0 0 13.4315 0 30C0 46.5685 13.4315 60 30 60Z" fill="white"></path><path d="M44 30L36 24V36L44 30Z" fill="white"></path><path d="M34 30L26 24V36L34 30Z" fill="white"></path><path d="M24 30L16 24V36L24 30Z" fill="white"></path></svg><svg class="_Y3Itd_iveSkipButton_PQAoZ aok-hidden ive-skip-backward-icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="60" height="60" viewBox="0 0 60 60" fill="none"><path d="M60 30C60 46.5685 46.5685 60 30 60C13.4315 60 0 46.5685 0 30C0 13.4315 13.4315 0 30 0C46.5685 0 60 13.4315 60 30Z" fill="black" fill-opacity="0.25"></path><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M30 57.3913C45.1278 57.3913 57.3913 45.1278 57.3913 30C57.3913 14.8722 45.1278 2.6087 30 2.6087C14.8722 2.6087 2.6087 14.8722 2.6087 30C2.6087 45.1278 14.8722 57.3913 30 57.3913ZM30 60C46.5685 60 60 46.5685 60 30C60 13.4315 46.5685 0 30 0C13.4315 0 0 13.4315 0 30C0 46.5685 13.4315 60 30 60Z" fill="white"></path><path d="M16 30L24 24V36L16 30Z" fill="white"></path><path d="M26 30L34 24V36L26 30Z" fill="white"></path><path d="M36 30L44 24V36L36 30Z" fill="white"></path></svg></div></div><div data-hook="reviewRichContentContainer" lang="en-US" class="_Y3Itd_contain-rich-content_2IORW"><p><span>Get more than one, it’s easy to lose, and good to have extras for getting multiple simultaneous temperature readings at different locations. I’ve never had one stop working, and that’s saying something since I’m a savage at handling tools. Works well at reading the temperature. Magnet back makes it easy to stick to registers. Battery lasts very long time and is easy to replace.</span></p></div></div></div></div><div class="a-reactive-container-gradient"></div></div></div><div data-hook="reviewExpandButtonContainer" class="a-cardui-footer _Y3Itd_no-padding_1A9ha"><div class="a-cardui-expand-control-footer _Y3Itd_read-more-less_2uDYd" data-csa-c-type="widget" data-csa-interaction-events="click"><a href="javascript:void(0)" class="a-c